unt":70},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"*Only 42 apps have more than one update date in the data, which gives 44 update gaps. For these, the average time between updates is 125 days and the median is 18 days, so this result is limited. Looking at all apps, the median app was last updated 80 days before the latest date in the data (8 Aug 2018). 32.8% of apps were updated within 30 days and 63.3% within 6 months, while 23.6% had not been updated for over a year. This shows most apps are updated regularly, but a good number are left without updates.*","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"**7. What is the impact of app size on the number of installs?**","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"# app size vs installs\nsize_data = df[[\"Size_MB\", \"Installs\"]].dropna()\n\ncorr = size_data[\"Size_MB\"].corr(np.log10(size_data[\"Installs\"] + 1))\nprint(\"Correlation between size and log installs:\", round(corr, 3))\n\n# median installs for each size group\nprint(df.groupby(\"Bucket_Size\")[\"Installs\"].agg([\"count\", \"median\"]))\n\nplt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))\nsns.scatterplot(data=size_data, x=\"Size_MB\", y=\"Installs\", alpha=0.4)\nplt.yscale(\"log\")\nplt.xlabel(\"App Size (MB)\")\nplt.ylabel(\"Installs (log scale)\")\nplt.title(\"App Size vs Installs\")\nplt.tight_layout()\nsavefig(\"m7_app_size_vs_installs.png\")","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-12T19:37:26.524675Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-12T19:37:26.525373Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-12T19:37:27.073522Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-11-12T19:37:26.525346Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-12T19:37:27.07257Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"Correlation between size and log installs: 0.334\n                    count     median\nBucket_Size                         \n0-10MB               3995    10000.0\n10-25MB              2211   100000.0\n25-50MB              1601   100000.0\n50-100MB             1024  1000000.0\nVaries with device   1