tween the best and worst genres is under 0.5 points, so genre has some effect on ratings but it is not very large.*","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"# Conclusion","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"**The project shows that app success depends on several factors rather than one single feature. High installs, positive ratings, user engagement, app category, genre, pricing, and regular maintenance all provide different perspectives on app performance. The findings can help developers understand user preferences, identify competitive categories, improve user experience, and make better decisions about app development and marketing.**","metadata":{}}]}